# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git default on Windows) rewrites every
# file to CRLF on checkout, while server/.prettierrc requires `endOfLine: "lf"`.
# The result is that a fresh clone fails `npm run lint` on every source file with
# thousands of "Delete ␍" errors. `eol=lf` overrides autocrlf so the working tree
# matches what Prettier expects on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
